Fixes #350.

Previously table resources were camelCase whereas function resources used the original case. Now we use the original case in both cases (pun not intended).

If you have code like `build.input.pgRegistry.pgResources.myTableName` that will now need to be `build.input.pgRegistry.pgResources.my_table_name` (or, alternatively, use the following inflection plugin:

```ts
export const CamelCaseTableResourceNamePlugin: GraphileConfig.Plugin = {
  name: "CamelCaseTableResourceNamePlugin",
  version: "0.0.0",

  inflection: {
    replace: {
      tableResourceName(previous, options, details) {
        return this.camelCase(previous!.call(this, details));
      },
    },
    ignoreReplaceIfNotExists: ["tableResourceName"],
  },
};
```
)

